# GEC UI Copy — Bilingual

This site is **bilingual by design**. Do not force English-only CMS rules.

## Pattern (match neighbors)

| Layer | Language |
|-------|----------|
| Nav / chrome / many section titles | English (e.g. Products, About Us, Featured Product) |
| Company & product body narrative | Indonesian (or source data language) |
| Agent chat with user | Follow the user’s language |

## Rules

- New copy should **match the surrounding section** — don’t invent a third dialect
- Do not mix ID and EN inside **one** user-facing string without reason
- Do **not** mass-translate the whole site unless explicitly asked
- Product JSON / Sheets content: keep author/source language; only polish if asked
- `aria-label` / `title`: same language as the control’s visible label when possible

## Examples

```jsx
// ✅ Nav chrome EN, body ID (existing About pattern)
<Title>About Us</Title>
<p>GEC adalah identitas brand dari PT Ganesha Multi Kreatif…</p>

// ❌ Random mix in one control
<Button>Create Artikel Sekarang</Button>
```

## Commits & code comments

Follow team preference — not constrained by this UI copy rule.
